# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets headers for the keyless PWA build.
# sw.js must revalidate (otherwise phones keep a stale worker); hashed
# assets + icons are immutable for a year; HTML shells must not be cached
# by the CDN (the worker's NetworkFirst handles offline instead).
#
# Security headers (docs/17 W7.1). The CSP is the real one, not just
# frame-ancestors: script/style/img/font/connect/frame sources are named
# so the browser refuses everything else. The inline bootstrap and
# hydration scripts in the prerendered shell are build-specific, so
# postbuild.mjs hashes them and injects the 'sha256-...' tokens into the
# deployed script-src (app/public/_headers stays valid without them, on
# purpose: an un-processed deploy fails visibly instead of silently
# dropping the whole policy, which a malformed token would cause). HSTS is
# deliberately absent until the custom domain is stable (docs/17 W7.1).
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
  Content-Type: application/javascript; charset=utf-8
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/icons/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
  Content-Type: application/manifest+json
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/404.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://checkout.razorpay.com https://www.paypal.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://api.qrserver.com; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co https://api.razorpay.com https://api-m.paypal.com https://www.paypal.com https://us.i.posthog.com https://*.ingest.sentry.io; frame-src https://api.razorpay.com https://hooks.razorpay.com https://www.paypal.com https://www.sandbox.paypal.com; worker-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
